%% ① 蒸馏：触发 → 产出 → 持久化
sequenceDiagram
    participant App as app.js(宿主)
    participant LTM as LTManager
    participant PF as PrivacyFilter
    participant D as Distiller
    participant C as LTMcrypto
    participant S as StorageBackend

    App->>LTM: distillFromTurns(turns, subject, sessionId)
    LTM->>PF: shouldBlock(turn.text)
    alt 命中 HARD/SOFT 边界
        PF-->>LTM: {blocked, reason} 丢弃该片段
    else 通过
        LTM->>D: extractItems(text, ctx)
        D-->>LTM: candidates[MemoryItem]
        LTM->>D: merge(existing, candidates)
        D-->>LTM: {merged, added, updated}
        loop 每条待存
            LTM->>C: encrypt(item, key)
            C-->>LTM: {iv, ct}
            LTM->>S: put(EncryptedRecord)
        end
        LTM-->>App: {added, updated}
    end

%% ② 新会话：检索 → 回灌注入 → engine 使用
sequenceDiagram
    participant App as app.js(herReply 前)
    participant MCP as mcp-client(identity)
    participant LTM as LTManager
    participant R as Retriever
    participant Engine as Engine(冻结)
    participant UI as LTMUI

    App->>MCP: identity()
    MCP-->>App: {subject, sessionId}
    App->>LTM: retrieveForSession(subject, query)
    LTM->>R: score(item, query)  (分词+标签+时间衰减)
    R-->>LTM: topK MemoryItem[]
    LTM-->>App: items
    App->>App: est.longTermMemories = items  (补充字段, 不覆盖 mindCtx)
    App->>App: buildMemoryFragment(items) → 注入云端/本地模型分支
    App->>Engine: reply(text, est)  (冻结引擎忽略 longTermMemories)
    Engine-->>App: replies
    App->>UI: renderRecallBubble(items) + renderCornerBadge

%% ③ 管理页 CRUD
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant UI as LTMUI
    participant LTM as LTManager
    participant C as LTMcrypto
    participant S as StorageBackend

    U->>UI: 打开管理页
    UI->>LTM: list(subject, filter)
    LTM->>S: getAllBySubject(subject)
    S-->>LTM: EncryptedRecord[]
    LTM->>C: decrypt(rec, key)
    C-->>LTM: MemoryItem[]
    LTM-->>UI: 列表渲染
    U->>UI: 编辑 content
    UI->>LTM: update(id, content)
    LTM->>S: put(updated)  (updated_at 留痕)
    U->>UI: 删除单条
    UI->>LTM: remove(id)
    LTM->>S: delete(id)
    U->>UI: 彻底清除全部
    UI->>UI: confirmWipe(scope) 二次确认
    UI->>LTM: clearSubject(subject) | clearAll()
    LTM->>S: deleteBySubject | clearAll (不可逆)
